{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yl43u1cr","slideIndex":8,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"Three samples per mode; seconds, median / 95th percentile.\n\nacquire: cold 1.483 / 2.220; warm 0.000 / 0.000\nvalidate: cold 0.005 / 0.005; warm 0.002 / 0.002\nimport: cold 0.391 / 0.426; warm 0.330 / 0.352\nexecute: cold 0.280 / 0.297; warm 0.265 / 0.284\ncleanup: cold 0.322 / 0.331; warm 0.329 / 0.330\n\nEmpty download cache; host/VM caches uncontrolled. The 95th percentile is the sample maximum.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
