{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/tozmdgbm","slideIndex":11,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"python3 -u scripts/reproduce_second_operator.py\n\nThe wrapper creates a digest-pinned disposable operator environment. New CA/client keys authenticate uid 1000 to its own empty nested engine. A client without its certificate is rejected.\n\nOnly the selected public source snapshot enters a clean Git checkout; no old credentials or business data are copied.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25.33,"typeface":"Courier","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
