{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2lcvup4v","slideIndex":12,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"All six cold/warm samples passed in the new operator context. Source hashes, account, certificate fingerprint, tool digest and empty before/after stores are retained in receipt.json. Fresh access was removed with the environment.\n\nNested memory cgroups were unavailable. Supported mode disables cgroups; CPU/memory/PID enforcement remains unqualified. Explicit file logging repaired empty runtime logs. The same candidate and integrity assertions ran.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
