{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0bu9s721","slideIndex":13,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"PBI-075: measured tool reuse, integrity checks and single-worker decision.\n\nPBI-078: technical second operator reproduced the selected source-to-result slice with newly issued private access. Same assistant and kernel; no human independence claim.\n\nYOLO review assesses the recorded laboratory outcomes. No remote publication or next sprint activation.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
